WEBVTT

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:04.810
Go back to Nafrece?

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:07.060
What are you thinking, Aoi?

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:10.120
She didn't make it in time for our meeting,

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:12.920
but Eve was there at the Nafrece airport.

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:14.990
So I need to head back and—

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:16.480
You know that's impossible!

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:19.530
You need to report to your mother — no,

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:21.520
your sponsor — about your victory.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:24.330
Then you need to talk to the media.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.880
I know... I know, but...

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.680
Aoi Amawashi! Congratulations 
on your victory!

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:33.720
How does it feel to be world champion?

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:36.240
U-Um...

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.430
Sorry.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:40.350
Please contact Athena's PR 
department for interviews.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:42.190
You could at least give 
us a short comment...

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:43.900
I'm sorry.

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.140
Let's go.

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:49.330
Talk to their PR?

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:50.830
She's just an amateur.

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:52.280
Well, what do you expect?

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:55.650
Aoi Amawashi's a walking 
advertisement for Athena's brand.

00:00:56.120 --> 00:01:02.030
They're saying she'll win a tour 
within six months and go pro.

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:05.400
Aoi, forget about her.

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:06.730
I can't...

00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:07.760
Amawashi.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:14.760
Congratulations on your victory.

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:17.880
Himekawa. Oikawa.

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:19.220
What are they doing here?

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:22.950
Look, that's Mizuho Himekawa!

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:25.010
The top female amateur player last year!

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:27.440
I watched you play.

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:31.750
But you can't have the high school title.

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:33.280
Be ready.

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:11.420
Congratulations!

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:14.580
Shinjo, too. Thanks for helping Aoi so much!

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:16.710
Thank you.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:21.260
It may have been a junior tournament, 
but the way you won so easily...!

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:25.040
The whole golf fandom is talking about you!

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:28.190
Our PR department 
is getting tons of calls...

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:31.770
Aoi, did you enjoy the game?

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:33.910
Yes! I did!

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:36.310
And I met someone wonderful too!

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:39.120
Her name's Eve! And she's great at golf!

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:41.400
I couldn't take my eyes 
off the way she played...

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:42.660
She was just so amazing!

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:43.390
Oww!

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:47.560
That's not what you're supposed to report.

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:50.380
What's her full name?

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:53.160
Eve Aleon.

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:54.760
I see.

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:57.520
Thanks for coming all this way to tell me.

00:03:57.520 --> 00:03:59.330
You two must be tired.

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:02.170
You can deal with the media tomorrow.

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:05.390
For today, go back to the mansion and rest.

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:23.660
Have our investigators look into Eve Aleon,

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:27.840
the girl who appeared 
at the U15 Women's Tournament.

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:28.910
<i>Understood.</i>

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:34.900
Honey, Aoi is our treasure.

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:40.880
I won't let anyone stop her on her road 
to being a tour pro and prize queen.

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:45.760
Even if that person's just 
a pebble on the road...

00:04:46.630 --> 00:04:49.800
I'll do everything I can to get rid of it.

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:55.090
<i>VR</i>

00:04:58.280 --> 00:05:01.120
PR sent us the interview schedule.

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:03.830
We'll be doing interviews all day tomorrow.

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:07.060
I'll give you the answers I want you 
to say. Memorize them.

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:12.280
Are you still thinking about her?

00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:14.870
I told you to forget about her.

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:16.540
Why?

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:18.720
Because she doesn't matter!

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:20.330
I looked into her a little,

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:24.130
and the name Eve Aleon doesn't appear 
on any lists of Nafrece junior golfers.

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:28.170
She just happened to have a special 
invitation to the championship.

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:35.680
Your path to being a tour pro 
will never intersect with her path.

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:46.860
She's been like that since the tournament.

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:50.110
She doesn't practice. She just lies there.

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:53.250
She's like an empty shell. 
Like she doesn't care.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:55.400
Like the party's ended.

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:56.480
What?

00:05:56.880 --> 00:06:00.730
I've only seen a few of her games.

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:02.370
But I can tell.

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:06.440
When I see how seriously 
she took that game...

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:12.400
I can tell that match with that 
Japanese girl must've been a lot of fun.

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:17.800
Hello?

00:06:18.650 --> 00:06:22.160
Got it! We'll be right there!

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:25.360
Eve! Work! The reward's 500 eurus!

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:27.980
No. Don't care. Boring. Stupid.

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:31.110
I already said yes!

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:36.580
Eve, does your stomach hurt?

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:38.140
Are you okay?

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:39.950
Did you eat something bad?

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:42.950
Just kidding.

00:06:42.950 --> 00:06:46.190
Let's go make some money.

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:49.350
Don't scare me like that, Eve!

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:50.820
Who are we playing?

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:52.040
Old man Kevin.

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:53.810
He saved up some money again.

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:55.110
Why doesn't he ever learn?

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:56.240
Who cares?

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:57.540
He's a cash cow!

00:06:57.550 --> 00:07:00.320
Our personal ATM!

00:06:57.550 --> 00:07:00.320
Yeah, that's right!

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:03.170
Eve, you...

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:08.800
One,

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:10.240
two,

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:12.480
three!

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:19.690
Haha! Kevin fell way short!

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:21.100
He's wasting his money!

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:23.320
My sides!

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:23.320
Shut up!

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:25.140
This is a 3 hole match!

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:26.800
I'll catch up soon!

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:29.380
Such a comedian! That's hilarious!

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:30.920
You stop talking!

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:33.640
Eve?

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:37.240
I won't bet.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:41.520
Golf is a sacred sport, 
and that would be an insult to it.

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:46.960
I'll be waiting here, at Hole 1,
 tomorrow at 5 AM.

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:48.940
Let's play golf right 
until it's time for my flight.

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:51.830
<i>Let's play golf right 
until it's time for my flight.</i>

00:07:57.880 --> 00:07:59.650
<i>This isn't golf.</i>

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:02.040
<i>I'm just hitting a ball with a stick.</i>

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:05.940
<i>This isn't golf. It's not...</i>

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:12.190
Into the bunker!

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:13.060
What's wrong?

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:16.920
Having a bad day, "Rainbow Bullet" Eve?

00:08:17.770 --> 00:08:18.800
Eve?

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:21.480
Just giving him a handicap.

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:25.920
Oh! Why didn't you say so?

00:08:26.760 --> 00:08:28.360
Let's keep playing.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:29.770
Yeah.

00:08:33.560 --> 00:08:36.240
<i>The heat's leaving my body.</i>

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:44.930
<i>I'll probably never feel that heat 
when I'm playing golf again.</i>

00:08:58.130 --> 00:08:59.510
Thanks.

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:04.030
We got the deed transferred over, too.

00:09:04.030 --> 00:09:05.820
Congratulations.

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:07.440
Thank you!

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:10.530
Now we can build that casino.

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:15.260
Thanks for introducing me to her, Rose.

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:17.200
Not at all, madame.

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:21.920
Hey, why don't we make her 
work for us exclusively?

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:23.120
She's young.

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:26.080
Give her some makeup 
and she'll attract fans.

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:30.090
And even if she loses the game, 
she can make us money by "serving" the fans.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:35.520
I think it's a wonderful idea, 
but it probably wouldn't work.

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:38.430
She's not the type to work for someone.

00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:41.410
I see. A shame.

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:42.960
I'll be going, then.

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:48.570
Oh, let me give you one warning.

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:52.160
You should leave her alone.

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:54.570
It won't go well for you if you try.

00:10:00.010 --> 00:10:02.320
She's warning me off.

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:05.750
She must really like her.

00:10:13.020 --> 00:10:14.380
Pizza!

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:15.430
Pizza.

00:10:15.430 --> 00:10:16.760
Can we eat it?

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.000
Of course...

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:19.590
Actually!

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:21.600
It's first come, first served!

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:27.430
Hey, don't steal it all!

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:29.320
It's so hot!

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:31.560
But it's so good!

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:34.050
Lily, no fair!

00:10:34.880 --> 00:10:36.800
You're not eating?

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:39.120
Yeah, I'm not hungry.

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:42.960
Hey, ever heard of VR?

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:45.370
VR? What's that?

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:47.710
Virtual reality.

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:50.360
You can enter a world created by a computer,

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:52.840
and experience things 
that would be impossible in real life,

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:54.600
or even play games.

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:59.000
There's even VR golf.

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:05.400
People from all around the world can come 
together and play golf in virtual reality.

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:08.930
Some of them are real pros!

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:10.670
Pros, huh?

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:13.250
The most popular version is Japanese.

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:16.310
And most of its players are Japanese, too.

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:19.320
I'm hungry now.

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:20.930
I'll go eat something.

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:21.690
What about the pizza?

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:25.820
<i>It's already gone, of course.</i>

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:45.760
VR arcade. VR arcade...

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:49.440
Here, huh?

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:08.640
There.

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:12.810
That's everything you need for VR.

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:15.620
I look kind of stupid.

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:18.620
You'll feel differently 
when you get into virtual reality.

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:20.960
Oh, what will you do for your avatar?

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:24.120
We 3D scanned your body a moment ago.

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:26.430
Would you like it to be 
the same as your physical body?

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:28.450
Whatever.

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:30.290
What about your outfit?

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:32.760
Just let me play!

00:12:33.010 --> 00:12:37.150
I'll choose an outfit for you, then.

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:42.490
Now, please enjoy 
a virtual reality experience

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.850
beyond anything the real world can offer,

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:47.410
using our company's most advanced VR system.

00:13:05.370 --> 00:13:06.840
W-What?

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:09.470
What is this outfit?

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:16.790
<i>How do you like it, ma'am?</i>

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:17.690
<i>This outfit is...</i>

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:18.470
Weird!

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:22.210
<i>I picked all of our most popular options...</i>

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:24.350
Your country is weird!

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:28.370
<i>I can choose another—</i>

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:30.440
Just let me play the game!

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:32.710
<i>Understood.</i>

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:37.800
<i>I will now move you to our highest difficulty 
course for one round of stroke play.</i>

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:41.550
<i>Please enjoy your game!</i>

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:48.880
Hmm, how do I pick a club?

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:58.430
Wow! It weighs the same 
as the one I usually use!

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:02.620
This course is brutal.

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:04.660
So this is their highest difficulty.

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:10.790
The highest score is... 23 players with -15.

00:14:11.110 --> 00:14:13.200
I get to do my thing in VR, huh?

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:16.870
Well, I'll give it a try.

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:19.740
<i>Loading the gun...</i>

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:22.460
<i>Direct strike!</i>

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.670
<i>Blue Bullet!</i>

00:14:35.590 --> 00:14:39.710
Today's top score. 13th place overall.

00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:42.520
So 12 people can shoot farther than me?

00:14:47.270 --> 00:14:50.520
Wow... so this is VR!

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:57.840
I can go through a whole 
course in less than an hour!

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:02.960
Sorry, we're closed...

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:05.300
Rose!

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:07.590
Did you talk to her about it?

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:09.480
Yes.

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:11.190
Where is Eve?

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:13.790
She left 3 hours ago.

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:14.880
I see.

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:17.040
Your pay.

00:15:17.380 --> 00:15:18.900
So much...?

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:21.930
It's an investment. I'll make it back.

00:15:21.930 --> 00:15:23.740
You've got a lot of kids around, right?

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:24.880
Take it.

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:28.070
What are you going to do with Eve?

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:32.310
If you're trying to manipulate her...

00:15:33.560 --> 00:15:34.930
Don't worry.

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:38.340
It's for her sake and ours.

00:15:38.340 --> 00:15:40.460
It's a win-win relationship.

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:49.510
Now, I've started rolling the pebble.

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:51.510
Let's see how far it goes.

00:15:52.520 --> 00:15:54.260
<i>There's no movement time.</i>

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:57.400
<i>So I don't get tired 
at all even after a full round.</i>

00:15:57.850 --> 00:15:59.400
Makes sense.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:03.880
I'm not even moving except for the shots.

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:08.800
I finished 10 under on my first round.

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:12.400
And my score is... 2nd?

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:16.120
Who's scoring higher than me?

00:16:16.720 --> 00:16:19.120
Althea?

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:20.450
Number 14?

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:21.660
Playing now?

00:16:22.110 --> 00:16:24.120
You think you can beat me, huh?

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:26.540
Fine. I'm fired up now.

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:32.420
Let's see what you can—

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:37.520
<i>That trajectory...</i>

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:42.440
<i>A 48-inch!</i>

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:47.440
No way...

00:16:49.430 --> 00:16:50.510
No way...

00:16:57.960 --> 00:16:59.020
Who are you?

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:03.520
Eve!

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:06.530
Eve!

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:09.280
W-Who are you?

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:10.780
Why were you late?

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:13.720
I waited until the last minute!

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:18.460
Are you...

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:20.660
Aoi Amawashi?

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:22.150
That's right!

00:17:22.150 --> 00:17:24.400
Why are you dressed like that?

00:17:24.400 --> 00:17:26.880
I don't want people finding out who I am.

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:29.860
I'm actually kind of famous, you know.

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:33.770
I didn't think I'd really see you...

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:35.530
What?

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:37.960
You're the one who invited me, right?

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:38.950
I did?

00:17:39.310 --> 00:17:43.060
An hour ago, I got a message.

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:45.370
It said it was from you!

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:47.670
I didn't send that!

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:49.880
What do you mean by that?

00:17:50.240 --> 00:17:53.320
How am I supposed to know?

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:54.490
Well, whatever.

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:56.140
What matters is that we met.

00:17:56.530 --> 00:18:00.600
But I'm mad that you broke your promise!

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:04.390
I'm sorry about that.

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:07.110
I apologize. Please forgive me.

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:10.280
There was something 
I just couldn't get out of.

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:13.810
I hurried to the course 
as soon as it was over...

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:17.360
But I didn't make it in time.

00:18:17.850 --> 00:18:19.580
I was really mad!

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:21.600
I thought you were a liar!

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:23.780
I waited...

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:27.370
I was so excited I couldn't sleep...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:34.090
But now that we've met 
each other, it's okay!

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:35.640
Let's keep our promise!

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:38.800
Let's go a round together!

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:41.480
Sounds great.

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:44.190
So, who gets the honor?

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:45.260
Want to do a coin toss?

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:49.550
I think I'm more experienced 
with VR than you.

00:18:49.550 --> 00:18:50.990
So I'll go first.

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:56.280
Watch my play and see if you can 
learn anything about playing VR.

00:18:56.280 --> 00:19:00.280
No. That's not a real game.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:04.170
I <i>knew</i> you'd say that.

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:07.160
But I'll go first anyway.

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:12.060
We met, we played a hole,

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:14.970
we played on the last 
day of the championship...

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:18.720
And yet I've never lost to you.

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:22.290
So I've got honor!

00:19:27.280 --> 00:19:30.390
<i>Fine by me. I'm taking back the honor.</i>

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:32.480
<i>I'll shoot you through...</i>

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:35.910
<i>With my Rainbow Bullet!</i>

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:38.560
<i>That's right, Eve.</i>

00:19:38.560 --> 00:19:40.560
<i>Keep it up.</i>

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:47.030
Miss CEO, Kuchinishi from our 
investigation department is here.

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:48.390
Send him in.

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:50.960
<b>Investigation Report</b>

00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:53.310
You found nothing?

00:19:53.310 --> 00:19:54.640
What do you mean?

00:19:54.640 --> 00:20:00.970
There is no girl named Eve Aleon 
under age 15 who lives in Nafrece.

00:20:01.620 --> 00:20:03.310
It may be a fake name.

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:05.810
So how'd she get into the tournament?

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:11.390
One of the official sponsors 
of the tournament insisted on it.

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:14.030
Then talk to them directly.

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:16.640
They're untouchable.

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:26.520
<i>That company has ties to the mafia.</i>

00:20:26.520 --> 00:20:27.600
<i>They're dangerous.</i>

00:20:27.600 --> 00:20:31.270
<i>It's not a good idea for our company 
to get further involved.</i>

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:35.960
An illegal golfer with ties to the Mafia...

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:39.330
<i>Guess I didn't need to
worry about her after all.</i>

00:20:40.110 --> 00:20:46.680
<i>No matter how good she is, 
she'll never face Aoi again.</i>

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:50.090
<i>They live in different worlds.</i>

00:22:16.220 --> 00:22:19.970
I've never gotten this tired in VR.

00:22:19.970 --> 00:22:21.480
But the game...

00:22:23.280 --> 00:22:26.020
I refuse to accept this!

00:22:26.020 --> 00:22:29.420
Whether I win or lose, this isn't real!

00:22:29.420 --> 00:22:34.040
I want to win against 
the real Aoi Amawashi, in reality!

00:22:35.010 --> 00:22:37.500
Then I can wait for you, right?

00:22:38.300 --> 00:22:41.130
I can wait for you to come to me, right?

00:22:41.960 --> 00:22:44.010
Someday, in the real world,

00:22:44.010 --> 00:22:48.610
you'll come to play against me 
as a regular player,

00:22:48.610 --> 00:22:51.580
not by special invitation, right?

00:22:52.150 --> 00:22:54.430
W-Well...

00:22:54.930 --> 00:22:56.630
Promise me.

00:22:57.570 --> 00:23:01.510
And this time, don't break your promise!

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:06.980
I...

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:09.040
E-Eve?

00:23:10.390 --> 00:23:12.530
Log... out?

00:23:16.320 --> 00:23:17.920
What was that?

00:23:19.400 --> 00:23:20.950
Lily?

00:23:21.760 --> 00:23:23.040
It's going away...

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:25.600
W-What's going away?

00:23:26.680 --> 00:23:28.700
The shop!

00:23:28.700 --> 00:23:30.970
Our home!

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:37.130
It's going away!

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:49.990
Next Episode

00:23:40.800 --> 00:23:42.400
I'm Vipère the Reaper!

00:23:42.400 --> 00:23:44.240
And don't call me snake woman!

00:23:44.240 --> 00:23:46.520
I don’t care what happens 
to Eve and her friends!

00:23:46.520 --> 00:23:50.190
My name is Vipère! <i>Vipère!</i>
